{
  "version": 1,
  "name_pattern": "^[a-z0-9]+(?:-[a-z0-9]+)*$",
  "command_pattern": "^/([a-z0-9]+(?:-[a-z0-9]+)*)(?:\\s+|$)",
  "reserved_names": [
    "agent",
    "bootstrap",
    "goal",
    "help",
    "memory",
    "models",
    "new",
    "status"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "只认行首：前导空白不是斜杠激活",
    "名字之后必须是空白或输入结束；/pdf-processingX 不是斜杠激活",
    "保留名是频道命令，永远不当技能"
  ]
}
